# Query-only is settled

Reads-only is the product default ([ADR 0002](docs/decisions/0002-query-only.md)). Do not stamp **query-only** on every title, description, and first sentence.

## Say once, if at all

Introduction or security can name the model. Driver and provider pages describe what that package does (`test`, `introspect`, parameterized `SELECT`).

## Do not

- Put “query-only” in every MDX `description`
- Repeat it in the first line of each driver/provider page
- Use it as a badge next to the package name

```mdx
<!-- Bad -->
description: "@db-sdk/postgres — query-only Postgres reads for DB SDK"

<!-- Good -->
description: "@db-sdk/postgres — Postgres reads for DB SDK"
```
